WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:08.008
Laurent, no matter how much
you mix into that candy,

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.759
my customers won't...

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:49.215
Such happiness
from just one piece of candy.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:57.474
This is the latest synthetic drug
created by Japan,

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:59.851
a leading country in pharmaceutics.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:03.021
It's magic,
or you could say "Sakura Magic."

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.815
Eddie, I'll sell exclusively to you.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:09.027
The wholesale price for a pack of 1,000
is 10,000 dollars.

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:12.363
Including the doctor's compensation,
initial fee,

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:15.325
and the exclusive contract fee,
it's five million dollars.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:17.160
In cash.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:19.245
That's an absurd price.

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:21.831
Since it's an absurd drug.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.000
You can carry it around,

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.544
and there's no worry about
scarring or rhinitis.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:28.546
Urine tests can't detect it.

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:31.674
If we have an exclusive contract,

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.345
celebrities from all over the world
would buy from you.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.721
And who can make it?

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:39.015
That's right.

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:42.393
It's this young expert from
the Chemical Research Institute of Japan.

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:44.687
The one and only Dr. Edamura.

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:47.232
Might as well.

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.276
Is there anyone else who'd like to try?

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.030
Give me some!

00:01:54.697 --> 00:01:56.199
-I was here first.
-Give me some.

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.367
-Hey.
-All right.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:00.078
How about
whoever takes the doctor's glass?

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:01.454
What did you say?

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:02.914
Open your mouth.

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:08.419
Hey, everyone, isn't the doctor amazing?

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.714
You'll get higher if you swallow it whole.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.928
All right, which mouth should I put it in?

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:40.285
Damn it.

